small_multi_dnf_set: permanent local repro for the DfaAdvGadget
discharge-combo bug (validate_discharge_sig_combo step-2.1).

Derived from small_data_set/config_dfa (same TEST1.bin, same cp/sed
sigs, same capacities). The only change: the DFA sig MULTIDNF_cs uses
a 2-subsig OR-clause (expr "0|1"), so when it discharges the DFA
discharge combo has count=2 (dnf_step 0,1) instead of count=1. The
count>=2 case activates the buggy step-2.1 well-formedness constraint
that is vacuous for count=1 (which is why small_data never tripped it).

Both subsigs are absent from TEST1.bin (39??????37: 9->7 distance is 8
nibbles not 6; 78??????79::i: x->y distance is 8 nibbles not 6), so the
clause evaluates all-False -> discharged, count=2.

Run: cargo test -p zkregplus --release --lib -- \
  zkp_driver::tests_zkp_driver::test_small_multi_dnf --exact --nocapture
Buggy  -> panics at assert!(verify_batch) (or 62730.2 with ZKR_GADGET_CHECK=1).
Fixed  -> test passes.
